    "optional_repeat": "gpu (L4): reported only, as layout-differences against the judged CPU run; not a verdict",
    "note": "@3 IMEX ARS(2,2,2) with exponential stage gates (exponential_mean_rate_linear_target_gates@1); field solver @3 as P4. Judged runs on CPU; Cells-only terms from blind CPU runs at (1 ms, 0.1 ms) and (0.5 ms, 0.05 ms) INIT/SIM steps (SIM has channel dynamics)",
    "mapping": "network_world_adapter.py run-resolved (NETWORK_RESOLVED): one population per membrane patch and network channel, Nav1p2 -> nav1p2_m3h_regularized@1 (Na), Kir2p1 -> kir2p1_mh2@1 (K), NaLeak -> naleak_always_open@1 (Na), KLeak -> kleak_always_open@1 (K); max_permeability = max Dm / tm, abundance 1, relative permeability 1; availability 1, or 0 in INIT for 'init active: False'; gates (m_inf, h_inf)(0 V) in INIT and (m_inf, h_inf)(Cells' INIT-end patch Vm) at the SIM handoff (BETSE re-reads the network at SIM start)"
